      "origin_derivations": {
        "TLS-7": "SSL.listen/2 and SSL.handshake/3 normalize through ServerOptions.build/1, whose sni/1 is the only producer of {:fun, fun}: the caller :sni_fun, validated as arity one and exclusive with :sni_hosts. ListenSocket is opaque and built only by listen/2; transport_accept/2 passes its retained options to ServerConnection.start/3. The sole lookup/2 caller, select_identity/2, runs once for the first ClientHello and replaces only identity and signature_algorithms, retaining sni. The callback result is data: identity keyword options loaded by ClientIdentity.load/1 (TLS-2 password boundary); exceptions and invalid results become internal_error. No library producer supplies sni_fun; Hell forwards caller options. The user sni_fun body is the approved server callback boundary.",
